The trip plan satisfies all constraints: total of 18 days, stay durations as specified, direct flights between consecutive cities, and the meeting in Porto between days 16-18. The itinerary accounts for shared days when flying between cities (e.g., the flight day is counted for both the departure and arrival city).

The sequence of cities with direct flights is:
- Dubrovnik to Helsinki (direct flight)
- Helsinki to Reykjavik (direct flight)
- Reykjavik to Prague (direct flight)
- Prague to Valencia (direct flight)
- Valencia to Porto (direct flight)

The day ranges are assigned as follows:
- Dubrovnik: 4 days, starting on day 1 and ending on day 4 (days 1-4).
- Helsinki: 4 days, starting on day 4 (shared with Dubrovnik departure) and ending on day 7 (days 4-7).
- Reykjavik: 4 days, starting on day 7 (shared with Helsinki departure) and ending on day 10 (days 7-10).
- Prague: 3 days, starting on day 10 (shared with Reykjavik departure) and ending on day 12 (days 10-12).
- Valencia: 5 days, starting on day 12 (shared with Prague departure) and ending on day 16 (days 12-16).
- Porto: 3 days, starting on day 16 (shared with Valencia departure) and ending on day 18 (days 16-18), which includes the meeting window (days 16-18).

